(Human nature tells us to keep doing things the way we have been )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(doing them. Beware change. When the Internet came around in the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(early 1990s, few thought it would ever become a commonplace, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(household service. It was for geeks. Yet look where we are now \227 )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(everybody\222s grandparents and their pet dogs are on the Internet. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(And we couldn\222t do without it. That being said, the transition from )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(no connections to people all over the world being connected was a )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(big change.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin is often compared to the early Internet, a new and disrup)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tive technology that seems to be far ahead of its time. In part, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(that\222s true, as bitcoin is solving a technological problem that )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(most people don\222t think about in the first place. Not because the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(evidence isn\222t there, but simply because human nature rejects )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(changes as long as things \223still work fine the way they are.\224)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(And just like the Internet, it will take a rather long period, many )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(years at least, before bitcoin becomes mainstream technology. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Even though several great bitcoin projects and platforms are in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(development, it will take a lot of time until they are ready to be )Tj
T*
(used by the general public. On top of that, there need to be more )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(educational efforts regarding bitcoin that focus on the underly)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ing ideas and technology, rather than the \223alternative currency\224 )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(aspect.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(On the other hand, a lot of people have already put their trust in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bitcoin technology. Most of the technology in existence today is )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(focused on financial means, such as the remittance market. Bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(technology allows you to send money to anyone in the world, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(at little to no expense. In doing so, remittance players such as )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Western Union, Moneygram, and even traditional banks will poten)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tially face stiff competition from this \223fake Internet money,\224 as \)Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
0 -1.158 TD
( )Tj
EMC 
0 0 TD
(bitcoin is often called.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Whether you should put your trust in bitcoin technology is some)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(thing only you can decide for yourself. Bitcoin was, is, and will )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(always be intended to put you in control of your bitcoin money. If )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(you decide to embrace that freedom, you have plenty of reading )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ahead of you in this book. We believe it will be worth your while.)Tj
