(case, you will be able to convert any bitcoin transaction to your )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(preferred local currency immediately and have funds deposited to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(your bank account the next business day.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(From a consumer point of view, using bitcoin as a payment )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(method means you don\222t have to spend any of your cash, nor use )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a bank card or credit card linked to any of your bank accounts. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(However, in order to obtain bitcoin, you usually have to buy some )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(first, which does involve spending your own money. Have no fear )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(though \227 many other ways to earn bitcoin without investing your )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(money up front are explored in Chapter\0374.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin is all about letting the individual user control funds at any )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(given time. And that aspect scares a lot of people away, as govern)Tj
(-)Tj
T*
(ments and banks have been holding our hands along the way for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the past half century or so. Taking care of everything ourselves )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(can be a burden, as many do not want that responsibility. And if )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(you honestly feel that you don\222t want to invest your time in manag)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ing your money at your leisure, when you need it, at any given time )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(or place, then bitcoin is not for you.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(But if you\222re fed up with the current financial system of govern)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ments and banks, bitcoin is well worth the time and effort. No one )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(is saying that bitcoin has to replace the local currency you\222ve been \)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(using to date. Both systems can coexist peacefully. However, once )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(you start seeing the benefits and potential of using bitcoin for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(various types of purchases, you will feel a rush of excitement, and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(more importantly, invigorating financial freedom.)Tj
