(As you might expect from exchange services, they are the lead)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ing indicators of how current market prices are fluctuating. In the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(case of bitcoin exchanges, these prices can fluctuate by quite a )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bit, as each business runs on a slightly different business model. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Some bitcoin exchanges will pay you less when selling bitcoin and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ask a slightly lower market price when you want to buy bitcoin. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Other exchange platforms will offer you the current market value )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(but take a small cut \(0.05\2260.5 percent\) per executed transaction as\ )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(commission.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Even though bitcoin is all about supply and demand based on )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the open market, buyers and sellers still need to be connected. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Most bitcoin exchanges use a )Tj
/T1_3 1 Tf
(trading engine,)Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
( which automatically )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(matches buy and sell orders on both sides of the order book. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(However, there are other options too, such as local peer\037to\037peer )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(trades, covered later in this chapter.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(A very important aspect of bitcoin exchanges is the fact that )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(some \227 though not all \227 platforms allow you to exchange BTC to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a global currency that is not necessarily your local currency. For )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(example, if you live in China, your local currency is the Chinese )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Yuan. However, if you want to get your hands on U.S. dollars )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(\(USD\), euros \(EUR\), or British pounds \(GBP\), you may choose to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(use a bitcoin exchange trading in those currency pairs.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(When attempting to make a withdrawal to your bank account, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the value may still be converted to your local currency if your )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bank doesn\222t accept foreign currency transfers. Always do some )Tj
T*
(research before attempting these types of transfers and make sure )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(you are prepared for any associated risks in doing so.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin exchanges are obliged by their local laws and respective )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(national regulators of financial services and products to obtain )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(some of your personal information. This information includes, but )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(is not limited to, your full name, address, phone number \(mobile )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(and/or landline\) and country of residence. On top of that, most )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bitcoin exchanges require you to fill in your date of birth, which is )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(part of the identity verification process \(see the next section\).)Tj
