(Furthermore, a unified standard would be of great aid to regula)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tors. Bitcoin is being kept under close watch by regulators all )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(around the world, so it would be in the best interest of the bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(community to help them as much as we can. Regulators are tasked )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(with developing frameworks for bitcoin\222s financial activities, and if\ )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
