(Most individuals want to have as much control as possible over )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(their finances, and the same is true of bitcoin users. And if the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(devices you do your banking on are not properly secured, no one )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(will bail you out if you lose your money. In the case of bitcoin, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(security starts with users themselves, rather than signing up for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a service and trusting the service with their money. Keep in mind )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
