(transaction, but there is no name or physical location attached to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the address itself.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(That being said, the current financial infrastructure offers no over)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(sight as to how bitcoin\222s stored value is being used. The funds you )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(keep in a savings account are there for you to see, represented by )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a list of digits in terms of what the bank owes you. But everyone )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(knows banks are using your money to create more money, though )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(you have no idea how that is happening. All you know is that banks )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(are playing with your money, and if they lose too much of it, they )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(need to be bailed out by the government. Or to be more precise: )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Everyday consumers need to bail out the banks because they lost )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the money we let them safeguard for us.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The transparent nature of bitcoin and blockchain technology is )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(beneficial in so many ways to so many people. With more and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(more companies and developers focusing on additional uses for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
