(Traditional financial institutions want to hold on to any funds you )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(deposit as long as possible, so they can loan the money to other )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(service providers and accumulate interest on it. This is one of the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(reasons why wire transfers take several days to reach their desti)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(nation, as every bank wants to take a cut of the fees for as long as )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(they possibly can. Other reasons include the inherent slowness )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(of the banking clearing platforms such as the SWIFT network. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Although the pan\036European SEPA \(Single Euro Payments Area\) )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(platform has facilitated quicker wire transfers within European )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(countries, the actual performance and functionality may rely on )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(how the system has been implemented by individual banks.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Not that there is anything wrong with that \227 it\222s a business model\ )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(like any other. That said, the customer is the victim of these )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(delays, because late payments invoke more fees from the company )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(waiting for its money. There are ways to speed up the process, but )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(financial infrastructures are sticking to their old methods.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Or to be more precise, there is one way to change that system, and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(that is by uniting and demanding change. Wouldn\222t you like to see )Tj
T*
(your money stored on a public ledger, which you can check at all )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(times and send to anyone in the world without delays or transac)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tion costs? If the answer is yes, then bitcoin is worth checking out.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(No one is saying you need to put your full trust in bitcoin from the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(start, as there is a lot of information to sift through. But if you are \)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(willing to keep an open mind to what bitcoin stands for and the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(point it is trying to get across, you can make a weighted decision )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(on whether or not to put your trust in digital currencies.)Tj
