(Bitcoin is a financial tool that carries risks just like any other pay)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ment method or currency does. However, with bitcoin, those risks )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(are slightly different from traditional currencies and payments. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Part of that comes in the form of a rather volatile price, but then )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(again, any local currency fluctuates on a daily basis.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin and the underlying blockchain technology reduce a lot of )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the risks presented by traditional payment methods. There are no )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(chargebacks, fraud is tough due to transparency, and the transac)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tion fees are very low compared to credit cards, wire transfers, or )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(remittance services.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(That\222s not to say that there are no risks attached to bitcoin either \)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(though. It\222s a new breed of technology which is part ideology and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(part payment method. The technology is still under development )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(as we speak. We are still discovering potential use cases for block)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(chain technology. So if you\222re planning to invest in bitcoin from )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a technological development point of view, there is always risk )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(involved. Even the best solutions and implementations may not be )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(viable in the end, if nobody adopts them.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(But there is a flipside to that story as well. Blockchain technology )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(development shows lots of room for growth and creates jobs in the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(long run. Every new technological discovery needs people who can )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(implement and maintain this new advancement, and preferably in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a user\036friendly way.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(From a technological standpoint, there is hardly any risk when )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(investing in bitcoin itself. Investing in a company that is work)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ing on this new technology is a different matter altogether, but )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(that principle is the same for any company you want to invest )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(in. Bitcoin company investments are not inherently riskier than )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(investing in any other startup company.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(When it comes to speculating on the bitcoin price however, the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(story is a bit different. If you look at bitcoin from the perspective )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(of an investment vehicle that will likely gain value, there are quite )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
