(There are certain similarities to how other resources \227 such as )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(gold \227 are mined: The available supply is slowly increased as )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(more is being put into the mining process. That said, the way )Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
0 -1.158 TD
( )Tj
EMC 
0 0 TD
(bitcoins are mined is by solving complex computational problems, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(which require more resources as time progresses.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(To ensure that no more coins are generated every day than origi)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(nally intended, the mining process is linked to a )Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
(difficulty rating)Tj
/T1_1 1 Tf
(. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(This rating goes up as more computational power joins the bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(network, and decreases when there are fewer miners competing )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(for network blocks.)Tj
