(66)Tj
-0.013 Tc 2.181 -2.45 Td
(Day trading versus altcoins)Tj
/T1_1 1 Tf
0 Tc 9.5 0 0 9.5 99 548.1802 Tm
(Okay, so you have an idea of what day trading is from the previ)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ous section \(if you skipped it, flick back to get a definition\). Let m\e )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(introduce )Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
(altcoins)Tj
/T1_1 1 Tf
( \227 also known as alternative currencies. These )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(are bitcoin clones, bitcoin rivals \(boo, hiss!\). By the time you\222re\ )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(reading this book, there will be well over 4,000 different altcoins in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(existence.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(If you do not like to trade or speculate on the bitcoin against )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(fiat currency markets, you could trade against altcoins instead. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Altcoins seek to improve on the ideas bitcoin represents. Some )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(people feel the need for more anonymity, whereas other develop)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ers want to explore the boundaries of the underlying blockchain )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(technology. Rather than submitting their ideas to the bitcoin devel)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(opers, they use the bitcoin code, change the name, make some )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(minor tweaks, and launch it as a brand new digital currency.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Over the years, only a dozen or so altcoins have managed to stay )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(relevant over time, mostly thanks to a strong community and the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(integration of some unique features that have not made it to bit)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(coin core \(yet\). Nevertheless, none of these altcoin communities )Tj
T*
(is as large or as supportive as the bitcoin community. But that )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(doesn\222t mean there is no speculation going in the altcoin scene )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(either. And this is why so many day traders prefer to speculate on )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the altcoin markets, as there is a lot of room for quick profits and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(quick losses.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Most altcoins are created by )Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
(pump\037and\037dump)Tj
/T1_1 1 Tf
( groups. What this )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(means is that developers create a lot of hype for their coin and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(promise unique and interesting features. As people find out about )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(these promises, they are more eager to buy coins at a low price, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(which in turn pushes the price upward. A few altcoins that have )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(people who are actively working hard outside of pump\037and\037dump )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(groups include Litecoin, CasinoCoin, and Guldencoin.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Rather than pushing up the price by buying coins, some altcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(developers encourage community members to put down a lot of )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(money for a valueless altcoin. And once the price is high enough, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(these developers cash out, take their money, and work on a new )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(coin for next week.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(There are many altcoins to go around, and most of them will never )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(serve an actual purpose. However, if you can catch a few cheap )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(coins before the price increases, there is a nice amount of profit to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(be made. Never become too greedy though, as prices can plummet )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(even faster than they rise.)Tj
