(funding, a crowdfunding campaign allows you to decentralize the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(funding process by acquiring backers and supporters to provide )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(money up front. By accepting bitcoin as a payment method for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(your campaign, you can decentralize things even further and reach )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a global audience.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin provides businesses and individuals with a powerful tool )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(to raise funds for an upcoming or existing project. Considering the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(fact that bitcoin is not taxable in most countries, many people view )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(it as a safe haven for \223tax\037free\224 funding.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(When you convert the raised funds to fiat currency, you may be )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(taxed on them, depending on the amount you receive.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(When crowdfunding, never list a fake project or claim to do some)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(thing with the money you never intend to fulfill. Even though )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bitcoin is a non\037reversible payment method, people will hunt you )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(down if you try to run off with their money.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Luckily for bitcoin enthusiasts, most crowdfunding projects so far )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(have been legitimate, and most have delivered on their promises )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(as well. Depending on what type of project you list, it may take )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(additional time to reach your goals, especially if it involves block)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(chain technology development.)Tj
0.004 Tc -0.003 Tw 0 -2.316 TD
[(But not every project is using crowdfunding platforms for the right)4( )]TJ
0 Tw 0 -1.158 TD
[(reasons. Some people view crowdfunding as a way to get some)4( )]TJ
0 -1.158 TD
