(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ning of a new era for the disruptive digital currency and perhaps )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(of some currency speculators being shaken out of the market. In )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(simple financial terms, there was a bubble in the bitcoin price fol)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(lowed by a crash which has seen the price return to levels com)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(parable prior to the bubble. At the time of this writing, it remains )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(unclear who was right. But one thing\222s for sure: Reports about )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
