( Chapter\0374: Making Money with Bitcoin)Tj
/T1_1 1 Tf
20 0 0 20 362.38 615.6802 Tm
(75)Tj
-0.013 Tc -13.169 -2.45 Td
(Earning through faucets)Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
0 Tc 9.5 0 0 9.5 99 548.1802 Tm
(One of the easiest ways of earning parts of a bitcoin comes in the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(form of so\037called faucets. A )Tj
/T1_3 1 Tf
(faucet)Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
( is a website that lets users claim )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a tiny amount of bitcoin in a certain time period, which can range )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(anywhere from minutes to days.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Don\222t expect to get rich overnight by visiting various bitcoin fau)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(cets, because most of them will pay next to nothing. Then again, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(you\222re doing nothing to earn it.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin faucets operate on a simple principle: They keep on giving )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(out tiny chunks of bitcoin as long as there are advertisers willing )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(to spend money to have their banner hosted on the faucet )Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
( )Tj
EMC 
26.759 0 Td
(website )Tj
-26.759 -1.158 Td
(\(clicking the advertising banners generates small revenue for )Tj
T*
(the hosting website\). Fractional amounts of bitcoin are regularly )Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
0 -1.158 TD
( )Tj
EMC 
0 0 TD
(distributed, and the funds have to come from somewhere. In most )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(cases, bitcoin faucet operators pay out of their own pocket for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the first weeks or months until they can attract enough traffic and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(secure some advertising deals for their website.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(For the novice user, bitcoin faucets are a great way to collect )Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
0 -1.158 TD
( )Tj
EMC 
0 0 TD
(fractional amounts of bitcoin. However, visiting bitcoin faucets all )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(day long would still only get you $2 or $3 maximum, so there is )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(trade\037off in terms of whether it is worth your time. In most cases, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(it isn\222t worth your time, because there are more productive ways )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(to earn bitcoin, such as forum signature campaigns or completing )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(micro tasks \(see the previous sections for more on these\).)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(You can find more information on bitcoin faucets at )Tj
/T1_4 1 Tf
(https://)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(en.bitcoin.it/wiki/Bitcoin_faucet)Tj
/T1_2 1 Tf
(.)Tj
