[(can then be expor)-17(ted to cloud ser)-36(vices such as Dr)25(opbox or Google )]TJ
0 -1.158 TD
(Drive, or even sent to yourself via e-mail. Any application you have )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(installed on your mobile device with backup capabilities should be )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(available to use.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Authentication is an important security measure to prevent funds )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(being stolen or misused by someone who \223borrows\224 your phone. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Most mobile wallets enable a PIN code system, forcing users to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(enter a four\036 to six\036digit code before accessing the wallet itself\. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Failure to provide the correct PIN code within a certain amount )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(of attempts will automatically lock down the wallet. The bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(wallet owner will be notified either via SMS or e-mail with instruc)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tions on how to unlock the mobile wallet again.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(All in all, mobile bitcoin wallets can provide the best solutions )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(when balancing the needs of security and convenience, but it all )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(depends on the individual user in the end. If users are careless )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(with their device, or forget to back up their private key, there is )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(no option to restore access to their mobile bitcoin wallet. Bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(allows users to take full control \227 and full responsibility \227 at )Tj
T*
(every step, which includes responsibilities such as backing up )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(their mobile wallet.)Tj
