0 -1.158 TD
(hour to complete. Once those six confirmations have taken place )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(on a transaction, the coins become spendable for the recipient.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The hour it sometimes takes to complete \227 on average \227 can be )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(seen as both a blessing and a curse. The upside of waiting for six )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
