0 -1.158 TD
(tized by their transaction fee \(if required\).)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The relaying of bitcoin transactions is also subject to whether or )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(not a fee has been included. Relaying transactions ignores whether )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(or not all outputs are at least 0.01 BTC or more, but only checks )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(whether or not the transaction is labelled as \223free\224 or not. A \223\free\224 )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(transaction means whether or not a fee of 0.00001 BTC has been )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
