(Every transaction fee can be seen as a small reward to all miners )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(who solved the block that includes your transaction\(s\).)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The bitcoin mining process will come to a halt when all bitcoins )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(have been mined, which is estimated to happen in 2140. It is antici)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(pated that miners will keep solving network blocks \(that include )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(transactions\) in exchange for the transaction fees included for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(every individual transaction. There is much debate regarding these )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(fees and whether or not they should be increased to incentivize )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the miners. However, it will take many years until a consensus is )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(reached regarding that decision, so you shouldn\222t worry about it )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(right now.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Without mining fees, there is no incentive for miners to validate )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(your transactions. Even though no one is obligated to include a )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(transaction fee \227 unless decided upon otherwise by your bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(wallet \227 it is best practice to always include a minor fee in order )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(to support the bitcoin network and the individual miners.)Tj
