0 -2.316 TD
(You\222ll need to decide whether you want to keep every transaction )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(in BTC or not. There is a certain risk associated with keeping funds )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(in bitcoin, because the bitcoin price remains quite volatile on a )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(daily basis. Keeping funds in BTC can mean your sitting funds can )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(either increase or decrease in value. And depending on what type )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(of goods you\222re selling, and whether or not there are suppliers to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(pay, it might be a good idea to convert BTC funds immediately to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
