(trol them: aliens, the Loch Ness Monster, lawyers, and tax )Tj
-1.861 -1.158 Td
(officials. Like those, bitcoin control can only be enforced up until )Tj
T*
(a certain level. Outlawing bitcoin completely would never work )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(simply because there is no way to monitor it properly. Despite the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(blockchain\222s transparency, wallet addresses remain pseudony)Tj
