(And why would anyone want to outlaw bitcoin anyway? \(Actually, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(check out the sidebar later in this chapter for a few ideas.\))Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Certain aspects of bitcoin require further investigation in order )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(to build a regulatory framework. Using it as currency for legal )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(purposes, such as buying and selling goods or services, is not ille)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(gal. On the other hand, most central banks have warned financial )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(institutions and individuals about the risks associated with bitcoin, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(without outlawing the use of digital currency altogether.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
