(This chapter looks at bitcoin\222s legal situation in various countries \)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(and discusses what you can do to protect yourself and what you )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(need to do to keep the taxman happy.)Tj
/T1_0 1 Tf
