0 -1.158 TD
(issued their own bitcoin taxation guidelines, which may be revised )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(at a later date. The European Union will most likely not come to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a decision any time soon, yet the landscape could change at any )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(given time. Over in Asia, things are relatively quiet on the bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
