(In The Netherlands, things are very straightforward where bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(taxation is concerned. Bitcoin is treated like any other currency in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the country, and the same taxation guidelines apply to virtual cur)Tj
