(Slovenia decided not to tax the sale of bitcoins to exchanges or )Tj
T*
(other community members. However, bitcoin is subject to income )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(tax just like any regular currency in the country, and the taxation )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(amount is calculated according to the BTC/EUR exchange rate at )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the time of transaction.)Tj
