0 -1.158 TD
(side the scope of value added tax \(VAT\), which is a welcome move )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(for businesses within the sector. At the time of writing, it has been )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(announced that Jersey, another British Crown dependency, will )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
