(tax bitcoin on a federal level. Due to bitcoin\222s unknown impact on )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the economy, determining a proper taxation percentage is difficult, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(as well as which individuals or businesses should fall into this )Tj
-0.26 Tw /Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
