(Those who receive any form of income from virtual currencies )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(such as bitcoin should be subject to bitcoin taxation. However, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(this income can be divided into four different categories: wages, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(hobby income, bartering income, and gambling income. All of )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(these categories are subject to different taxation percentages.)Tj
