(. Despite the best efforts of bitcoin industry )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(experts, a central authority drafted rules for bitcoin companies in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the state of New York that a large segment of the bitcoin commu)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(nity deems harsh and unreasonable.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The main concern most bitcoin companies have with the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(BitLicense regulation is the extensive guidelines requiring )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(BitLicense to give customer information to the state of New York. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Many bitcoin industry leaders see this as an invasion of customer )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(privacy, leading quite a few companies to suspend services in the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(New York state area.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Applying for a BitLicense is subject to a $5,000 nonrefundable fee, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(in addition to legal costs easily ramping up to $20,000. There is no )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(guarantee that applying for a BitLicense will be successful, and bit)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(coin companies may be forced to provide additional details regard)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ing their business model or customers to state officials.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(On top of that, the BitLicense regulation contains some anti\036)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(money\036laundering guidelines that are in contrast with federal )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(guidelines. To make matters worse, bitcoin companies are being )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(scrutinized more than traditional financial institutions, which have )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(a notorious history of fraud, corruption, and mismanagement of )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(customer funds.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Bitcoin regulation will help legitimize the digital currency, but in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(our opinion BitLicense is an example of how it should not be done. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(The regulatory requirements put in place will hamper bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(growth in New York state, and the excessive costs associated with )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(obtaining a license are just not manageable by most companies at )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(this time.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The sum of $25,000 may not seem like much to make a business )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(legal in the state of New York, but most bitcoin companies have a )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(long\036term picture in mind. As more and more businesses comply )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(with BitLicense regulations, it will be seen as an incentive for other )Tj
