(there is no such thing as the \223the boss of bitcoin\224 or \223the CEO\ of )Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
0 -1.158 TD
( )Tj
EMC 
0 0 TD
(bitcoin.\224 Every individual user plays an integral role in the bitcoin\ )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(network, and all users are equal. And this makes it less of a juicy )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(target for hackers.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Trying to hack the bitcoin network would be like trying to hack )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the Internet. There is simply no way to do it. Both bitcoin and the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Internet are decentralized, with no central point of failure. Take )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(down one part, and the network routes around the problem and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(continues on. The same principle applies to bitcoin.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Having no central point of failure means there is no on/off button )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(for the bitcoin network itself. The bitcoin network spans the entire )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(globe across all continents, and it is impossible to shut down every )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(computer or other device connected to the bitcoin network at the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(same time. Not even governments could do it. Government officials )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(may have the power to ban bitcoin usage in certain countries, but )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(that doesn\222t mean the bitcoin network is not operational in those )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(parts of the world.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Furthermore, there is no incentive to hack the bitcoin network )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(either, because it wouldn\222t provide any financial benefit to hack)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ers. All the previous network blocks include BTC that have already )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(been distributed to other bitcoin users, and there is no chance )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(of changing that fact. Any new coins being generated, even if the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bitcoin network were to be hacked \(which is all but impossible\), )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(would not go to the hackers directly either.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(The bitcoin network is a technological marvel in its own right, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(as it provides levels of financial security we have never seen )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(before. Despite all of that promise, there is much about the bitcoin )Tj
