(The 51 percent attack is very unlikely to ever take place in the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(world of bitcoin, though it is not impossible. Once an attacker )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(gained hold of 51 percent \(or more\) of the bitcoin network\222s )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(computing power, he could exclude and modify the ordering of )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(transactions for as long as he was in control of the entire bitcoin )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(blockchain.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(A 51 percent attack could have some dire consequences for the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(bitcoin network as a whole. For example, the person, group, or )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(entity in charge of 51 percent of the bitcoin network would have )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the power to reverse transactions being sent while they were in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(control. Double\037spending transactions \227 the ability to spend the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(same amount of bitcoin twice \227 would become a real issue at that )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(time, and it would be impossible to tell which transfer was legit )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(and which wasn\222t \(more on this later in this chapter\).)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(On top of that, the person or people in charge could prevent )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(any and all transactions from getting network confirmations. )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Additionally, miners would be unable to mine any valid blocks on )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the network, with all earnings going to the people in charge, if they )Tj
T*
(so desired. This is the major reason why bitcoin industry experts )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(want to make sure a 51 percent attack can never take place under )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(any circumstance, even though it is all but impossible to prevent.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(But there are some extra points to make about this theoretical )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(situation. One of the things the attacker\(s\) wouldn\222t be able to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(do is reverse bitcoin transactions from other users, because they )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(have no control over that. Only their own transactions would be )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(affected \227 yet that alone could do some major damage to the )Tj
/Span<</ActualText<FEFF00AD>>> BDC 
0 -1.158 TD
( )Tj
