(Other forms of using bitcoin as an investment vehicle exist as )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(well. Investing in bitcoin can be a part of a long\037term plan, rather \)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(than an attempt at quick profits and losses. Bitcoin is still in the )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
