(The main purpose of bitcoin, as we see it anyway, has always been )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(to educate people on the potential of the blockchain and how to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(take back full control of their lives, not just from a financial per)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(spective, but also in the way people use services, platforms, tech)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(nology, and more importantly, how they look at the world.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Everywhere you look, you\222ll find fraud, corruption, mismanage)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(ment, financial restrictions, limited free speech, and many other )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(things that should not be issues in this day and age. When Satoshi )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Nakamoto created bitcoin, the idea was not only to create a new )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(breed of disruptive technology, but also to show everyday people )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(that there are solutions available to decentralize our entire life)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(style and avoid such nastiness as fraud and corruption.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(Up until now, most of bitcoin\222s focus has been on the price and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the financial aspect of the technology. There\222s a lot of room for )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(improvements in this market, and bitcoin is a fun tool to explain to )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(people how the financial system can \227 and perhaps should \227 be )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(changed.)Tj
0 -2.316 TD
(But it goes much further than that, as bitcoin\222s educational prow)Tj
(-)Tj
-0.001 Tw 0 -1.158 TD
(ess extends beyond finance and technology. The potential of block)Tj
0 Tw (-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(chain technology and bitcoin 2.0 is wide\037reaching, as discussed in )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(Chapter\0367. Once you understand the functionality of bitcoin and )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(the blockchain, dear reader, you will also be free to think about )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(its potential in other aspects of everyday life. Think for a moment, )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(for example, how majority consensus could be reached, even with)Tj
(-)Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(out having to rely on the human element in the equation. Digital )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(voting, negotiating and amending contracts, signing and storing )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(documents, and revamping the peer\037to\037peer way of transacting )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(are just a few examples of bitcoin\222s educational potential through )Tj
0 -1.158 TD
(unleashing the potential of the blockchain.)Tj
